## **Device Changelog** ##

**sweet (22/04/2025)**
```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Update common blobs from sweet k6a OS1.0.15.0.THGMIXM
- Import ril stack from mojito V14.0.8.0.SKGMIXM
- Enable ELF checks for libwpa_client dependent libs
- Update tetheroffload: Version 1.1
- Decrease swappiness to 60
- rro_overlays: WifiOverlay: Move to vendor
- sepolicy: Address/Silence some denials
- Set ro.boot.hardware.revision property
- Migrate to QTI USB Gadget AIDL HAL
- Switch to common QTI USB init scripts
- Build QTI Thermal AIDL HAL
- Add libwfdservice_shim for WFD
- Drop TARGET_DISABLED_UBWC
- Add support for Device as Webcam
- Bump manifest target-level to 6
- Cap max brightness for flashlight strength
- Add feature flag for IPSEC_TUNNEL_MIGRATION
- Misc improvements
```

**sweet (15/02/2025)**
```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Audio: remove direct flag for VOIP RX
- Media: Import Codec2 configs
- Disable OMX service
- Uprev audio HAL to V7
- Update public.libraries.txt
- Update dolby atmos stack from Oplus
- Add support for livedisplay
- Add support to control flashlight strength
```

**sweet (10/01/2025)**
```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Bring back MiuiCamera
- Bring back QCOM WFD
- Update display flags and packages
- Unpin libril-qc-hal-qmi.so and add missing qcriNvOpt radio dependency
- Update WFD system blobs from dodge AP3A.240617.008
- Added basic call recorder
- Misc improvements
```

**sweet (25/12/2024)**

```bash
- Upstream kernel
- Dropped miuicamera for now in favour of Aperture
- Set 120Hz frame rate multiple threshold
- Enable elfchecks for libgrallocutils
- Enable elfchecks for camera libs
- AIDL fingerprint improvements
- Mark CNE symlink target as required package
```

**sweet (07/11/2024)**

```bash
- Initial Release
- Update common blobs from sweet_k6a OS1.0.10.0.THGMIXM
- Switch to pixel power-libperfmgr
- Fixed a rare issue where plugging in some wired headphones would cause the phone to soft reboot
- Fixed an audio issue in certain apps (Eg: Teams, Skype, Mobile Legends)
- Improvements to the AIDL fingerprint HAL
- Upstreamed kernel
```
